# The menu of the right button (Ctrl+K here: a tape has no mouse).
Set Width 1584
Set Height 800
Source "docs/tapes/ambiente.tape"
Output "docs/media/.scarto/menu.gif"
Type "rada --icons nerd --images halfblocks --demo vetrina ~/projects/demo"
Enter
Sleep 2s
Show
Sleep 800ms
Ctrl+K
Sleep 2500ms
Screenshot "docs/screenshots/menu.png"
Sleep 1s
